Hi Mari! In my experience it's better to put each variable as a different label. That's because later when reading into R those labels, each one becomes a column in a data frame. The inner hierarchy of each label becomes the different levels on that categorical variable. For example, I usually do it this way for the label "number of individuals" with an inner hierarchy "1", "2", "3", ... Hope this helps!

Lucía RP

